# --- added Sep 2026, chromosome 3 LD panel -------------------------------
# PLINK square r2 matrices. The full one is 681 MB and the thinned one 75 MB,
# both over what GitHub will take. scripts/new_new_script/50_Fig_regional_chr3_locus.R
# carries the plink/awk commands that rebuild them from SAP_ldpanel, and the
# small files they are derived from (the snplist and the lead-SNP r2 column)
# stay tracked so panels A and B of that figure remain reproducible here.
data/LD_mapped/LD_chr3/*.ld
data/LD_mapped/LD_chr3/thinned/*.ld
data/LD_mapped/LD_chr3/*.nosex

